Call the police.

268
00:22:22,945 --> 00:22:24,505
Someone like him must be punished.

269
00:22:43,425 --> 00:22:45,265
Dony has powerful connections.

270
00:22:45,345 --> 00:22:48,465
We don't know how far
the investigation will go.

271
00:22:51,105 --> 00:22:52,585
But I want to make one thing clear.

272
00:22:52,665 --> 00:22:55,785
Luke and I will make sure
he goes to prison.

273
00:22:58,625 --> 00:22:59,465
I know.

274
00:23:00,305 --> 00:23:01,225
I'm not afraid.

275
00:23:02,065 --> 00:23:04,185
I just want him
to be punished for what he did.

276
00:23:07,825 --> 00:23:11,145
Flora, the first time I met you,

277
00:23:11,225 --> 00:23:14,265
I knew you were
an extraordinary young woman.

278
00:23:15,265 --> 00:23:17,345
I went against everyone else to hire you.

279
00:23:18,865 --> 00:23:22,585
Looking back, it was a great decision.

280
00:23:25,305 --> 00:23:26,345
Thank you.

281
00:23:27,625 --> 00:23:29,185
Thank you for always believing in me.

282
00:23:40,705 --> 00:23:41,865
Ms. Shang,

283
00:23:42,465 --> 00:23:46,905
Headquarters takes the complaint you filed
against Dony Chen very seriously.

284
00:23:46,985 --> 00:23:48,545
But the situation now

285
00:23:48,625 --> 00:23:52,425
is extremely complicated
and highly sensitive.

286
00:23:53,025 --> 00:23:54,185
Although the police
have opened a criminal case,

287
00:23:54,265 --> 00:23:55,785
this is ultimately
an internal matter at Lime.

288
00:23:55,865 --> 00:23:58,985
Issuing a public statement
could cause immeasurable damage

289
00:23:59,065 --> 00:24:01,105
to the company's reputation
and share price.

290
00:24:01,185 --> 00:24:02,705
We understand what you've been through,

291
00:24:02,785 --> 00:24:05,745
but we still hope you'll settle the matter
privately within the company.

292
00:24:06,545 --> 00:24:07,385
Of course,

293
00:24:07,465 --> 00:24:10,425
the company is prepared to offer you
substantial financial compensation

294
00:24:10,505 --> 00:24:11,505
and job security.

295
00:24:14,105 --> 00:24:15,785
Thank you for the offer,

296
00:24:16,545 --> 00:24:18,385
but what I want is justice.

297
00:24:19,225 --> 00:24:22,825
Agreeing to a settlement
would allow a criminal

298
00:24:22,905 --> 00:24:24,105
to continue to walk free.

299
00:24:24,185 --> 00:24:26,305
I trust the company
won't handle it that way.

300
00:24:26,385 --> 00:24:29,705
But the recording you submitted
doesn't clearly establish what happened.

301
00:24:29,785 --> 00:24:31,185
It alone isn't enough
to secure a conviction.

302
00:24:35,225 --> 00:24:39,145
What I want is for Dony Chen
to be punished for sexual harassment.

303
00:24:39,665 --> 00:24:40,665
Just because he got away with it before

304
00:24:40,745 --> 00:24:42,785
doesn't mean every woman
is an easy target.

305
00:24:43,465 --> 00:24:44,785
I won't settle.

306
00:24:53,905 --> 00:24:54,945
This contains evidence

307
00:24:55,545 --> 00:24:57,705
that he tried to force himself on me
and sexually harassed me.

308
00:25:04,065 --> 00:25:05,425
I was instructed to trace the funds

309
00:25:05,505 --> 00:25:08,905
flowing through the high-end tea shops
Dony selected and Lanyuan.

310
00:25:09,505 --> 00:25:13,065
The money ultimately went
into a private overseas account.

311
00:25:35,945 --> 00:25:38,585
These are the materials
I gathered for my complaint against Dony.

312
00:26:14,345 --> 00:26:15,745
A recording isn't foolproof.

313
00:26:16,745 --> 00:26:18,945
What if things had gotten out of control?

314
00:26:20,625 --> 00:26:23,865
I'd already made arrangements
with Kitty and Lucy.

315
00:26:25,025 --> 00:26:26,505
I knew I wouldn't be in any danger.

316
00:26:29,185 --> 00:26:30,825
You were in Hangzhou for 13 days.

317
00:26:31,745 --> 00:26:34,025
We spoke on the phone 26 times.

318
00:26:34,625 --> 00:26:37,025
Yet you never said a word
about any of this.

319
00:26:39,985 --> 00:26:41,105
I want to know why.

320
00:26:43,705 --> 00:26:46,705
You were already under intense scrutiny.

321
00:26:46,785 --> 00:26:49,585
I… I didn't want
to cause you more trouble.

322
00:26:59,425 --> 00:27:01,505
Correct me if I'm wrong, but I asked you.

323
00:27:02,505 --> 00:27:04,225
I asked whether Dony had harassed you,

324
00:27:04,945 --> 00:27:05,985
and you said no.

325
00:27:12,185 --> 00:27:13,465
Good for you, Shang Zhitao.

326
00:27:14,545 --> 00:27:18,225
You're so strong now
that you don't need anyone to protect you.

327
00:27:19,425 --> 00:27:21,065
Clearheaded and independent.

328
00:27:21,945 --> 00:27:23,905
I can hardly resist applauding you.

329
00:27:30,065 --> 00:27:31,065
Luan Nian.

330
00:27:35,225 --> 00:27:36,625
I'm exhausted. I…

331
00:27:36,705 --> 00:27:38,505
I just want to go home and sleep.

332
00:27:41,785 --> 00:27:43,025
You've certainly been through a lot.

333
00:27:43,545 --> 00:27:44,705
Go home and rest.

334
00:28:08,705 --> 00:28:10,065
Good for you, Shang Zhitao.

335
00:28:10,145 --> 00:28:14,065
You're so strong now
that you don't need anyone to protect you.

336
00:28:33,865 --> 00:28:34,945
It's over now.

337
00:28:35,025 --> 00:28:36,065
Everything's OK.

338
00:28:53,945 --> 00:28:54,865
You're here, right?

339
00:28:55,825 --> 00:28:57,265
I'll bring her down now.

340
00:29:10,025 --> 00:29:11,705
According to our investigation,

341
00:29:11,785 --> 00:29:13,905
Dony may be involved
in more than just this case.

342
00:29:14,425 --> 00:29:16,385
There is also evidence of embezzlement
and other illegal activity.

343
00:29:16,465 --> 00:29:18,505
Dony was hired by Headquarters,

344
00:29:18,585 --> 00:29:21,105
and his background check
was never handled by Lime China.

345
00:29:21,185 --> 00:29:23,345
The group also made a serious error
in appointing him.

346
00:29:25,945 --> 00:29:28,945
None of the materials you've provided
have been verified.

347
00:29:29,025 --> 00:29:31,425
Some are even complaint records
from years ago,

348
00:29:31,505 --> 00:29:33,985
from different companies
with different systems.

349
00:29:34,505 --> 00:29:35,505
Moreover,

350
00:29:35,585 --> 00:29:39,785
none of them resulted in any substantive
disciplinary action or legal consequences.

351
00:29:40,505 --> 00:29:44,785
Luke, you and Dony disagreed
over the New Media strategy.

352
00:29:44,865 --> 00:29:45,985
If you use company resources

353
00:29:46,065 --> 00:29:48,105
to investigate his private life
from years ago because of that,

354
00:29:48,705 --> 00:29:50,225
it'll be a serious breach
of management principles

355
00:29:50,305 --> 00:29:51,865
and could constitute
an abuse of authority.

356
00:29:51,945 --> 00:29:55,065
Of course, we will review
the matter carefully,

357
00:29:55,665 --> 00:29:59,745
but we must also consider the company's
overall stability and reputation.

358
00:30:03,865 --> 00:30:06,185
I don't know whose interests
Dony truly represents,

359
00:30:06,825 --> 00:30:10,585
but this disastrous appointment
proves the company has no trust in me.

360
00:30:15,785 --> 00:30:18,145
Today, I resign
from every position I hold at Lime.

361
00:31:47,385 --> 00:31:48,065
Hello?

362
00:31:48,145 --> 00:31:49,785
The board is in an uproar.

363
00:31:49,865 --> 00:31:51,545
They want you online for a meeting.

364
00:31:51,625 --> 00:31:52,745
I'm not going.

365
00:31:54,705 --> 00:31:56,105
People are already
talking about it online,

366
00:31:56,185 --> 00:31:57,745
and the share price is falling.

367
00:31:58,265 --> 00:31:59,145
Serves them right.

368
00:32:01,025 --> 00:32:02,025
So,

369
00:32:03,345 --> 00:32:04,265
are you really resigning?

370
00:32:04,865 --> 00:32:05,705
Yes.

371
00:32:10,025 --> 00:32:11,785
It's fine to teach them a lesson,

372
00:32:11,865 --> 00:32:15,385
but resigning wasn't part of our plan.

373
00:32:16,865 --> 00:32:18,545
I'm not trying to teach them a lesson.

374
00:32:19,065 --> 00:32:20,625
I really am resigning.

375
00:32:21,825 --> 00:32:22,985
Are you sure you're serious?

376
00:32:23,065 --> 00:32:24,265
I am.

377
00:32:25,385 --> 00:32:26,985
Tell the board
to find a replacement quickly.

378
00:32:27,065 --> 00:32:28,745
I'm taking leave starting today.

379
00:32:48,745 --> 00:32:53,225
The flight from Hangzhou to Beijing
covers 1,520 kilometers.

380
00:32:54,345 --> 00:32:55,905
I was trembling the entire way.

381
00:32:57,105 --> 00:32:58,785
Keep this up, and I'll scream.

382
00:32:58,865 --> 00:33:00,065
Let go of me!

383
00:33:01,585 --> 00:33:04,465
You were already under intense scrutiny.

384
00:33:04,545 --> 00:33:06,345
I didn't want to cause you more trouble.

385
00:33:18,385 --> 00:33:19,225
SHANG ZHITAO

386
00:33:24,465 --> 00:33:25,625
Hello?

387
00:33:25,705 --> 00:33:26,585
Hello?

388
00:33:27,265 --> 00:33:29,265
Hello. This is Luan Nian.

389
00:33:30,105 --> 00:33:31,505
May I speak to Shang Zhitao?

390
00:33:32,225 --> 00:33:33,545
Tao is asleep.

391
00:33:36,425 --> 00:33:37,785
She's exhausted.

392
00:33:38,545 --> 00:33:41,505
When she wakes up,
I'll tell her you called.

393
00:33:41,585 --> 00:33:43,345
-OK?
-OK.

394
00:33:44,665 --> 00:33:45,545
Thank you.

395
00:33:59,545 --> 00:34:04,745
TIANTONG DONGYUAN, SECTION 1

396
00:34:21,824 --> 00:34:22,665
Hello?

397
00:34:22,744 --> 00:34:24,824
Sun Yu said you called me.

398
00:34:26,905 --> 00:34:27,784
I did.

399
00:34:28,425 --> 00:34:29,505
What is it?

400
00:34:31,585 --> 00:34:32,585
I came to apologize.

401
00:34:35,585 --> 00:34:36,865
I'm downstairs.

402
00:34:47,824 --> 00:34:49,625
There's no rush. Take your time.

403
00:36:28,905 --> 00:36:30,145
I want to see the moon.

404
00:36:36,865 --> 00:36:37,705
OK.

405
00:36:58,745 --> 00:37:01,025
Kitty said she was terrified.

406
00:37:03,905 --> 00:37:04,905
Were you scared?

407
00:37:19,825 --> 00:37:20,945
We agreed

408
00:37:21,905 --> 00:37:23,185
to be honest with each other.

409
00:37:25,745 --> 00:37:27,785
But you had plenty of people around you,

410
00:37:27,865 --> 00:37:30,305
so you never needed to ask me for help.

411
00:37:31,225 --> 00:37:32,985
You wouldn't even tell me the truth.

412
00:37:35,305 --> 00:37:37,305
I didn't feel it was my place to tell you.

413
00:37:38,105 --> 00:37:40,825
It involved Kitty's privacy.

414
00:37:40,905 --> 00:37:42,705
Then why was it your place to tell others?

415
00:37:43,665 --> 00:37:44,825
Who do you mean?

416
00:37:45,545 --> 00:37:48,065
Throughout all of this,
I was the last to know.

417
00:37:50,265 --> 00:37:51,505
Shang Zhitao.

418
00:37:52,505 --> 00:37:54,065
Do you even see me as your boyfriend?

419
00:37:55,785 --> 00:37:58,905
Luan Nian, don't talk like that.

420
00:37:59,705 --> 00:38:01,545
Of course I see you as my boyfriend.

421
00:38:15,265 --> 00:38:16,305
Luan Nian.

422
00:38:20,785 --> 00:38:21,945
I've learned my lesson.

423
00:38:23,425 --> 00:38:24,665
It won't happen again.

424
00:38:51,505 --> 00:38:52,345
Your punishment.

425
00:38:59,785 --> 00:39:03,305
Lumi said you're resigning?

426
00:39:06,745 --> 00:39:08,065
Because of me?

427
00:39:08,145 --> 00:39:09,545
Because I'm rich.

428
00:39:10,065 --> 00:39:12,025
I can quit whenever I want.

429
00:39:18,225 --> 00:39:22,625
Could you not resign
and keep being my boss?

430
00:39:23,545 --> 00:39:25,345
I like working with you.

431
00:39:25,865 --> 00:39:27,825
I feel like I learn a lot.

432
00:39:28,345 --> 00:39:29,905
And…

433
00:39:32,825 --> 00:39:34,905
I get to see you often.

434
00:40:11,745 --> 00:40:13,545
LMAD STOCK PRICE

435
00:40:29,425 --> 00:40:31,305
Luke, when are you going back to work?

436
00:40:34,705 --> 00:40:35,545
I'm not.

437
00:40:37,345 --> 00:40:40,105
Running this bar must cost quite a bit.

438
00:40:42,145 --> 00:40:43,305
It's manageable.

439
00:40:43,385 --> 00:40:45,665
I can afford it.

440
00:40:46,905 --> 00:40:47,745
Luke,

441
00:40:47,825 --> 00:40:51,145
you can have full control
of Lime China from now on.

442
00:40:51,225 --> 00:40:53,185
You've all come all the way from the US.

443
00:40:53,265 --> 00:40:55,025
I know it wasn't an easy trip.

444
00:40:55,105 --> 00:40:56,145
Enjoy yourselves tonight.

445
00:40:56,225 --> 00:40:57,665
The drinks are on me.

446
00:40:57,745 --> 00:40:59,225
Then go back and get some sleep.

447
00:40:59,305 --> 00:41:00,465
Just name your terms.

448
00:41:02,065 --> 00:41:04,465
Then process my resignation
as soon as possible.

449
00:41:08,385 --> 00:41:09,225
Luke,

450
00:41:09,985 --> 00:41:12,185
we came here in good faith.

451
00:41:12,265 --> 00:41:14,425
Why don't you tell us
what you have in mind?

452
00:41:15,905 --> 00:41:18,465
What Dony did
caused our employees great harm.

453
00:41:19,065 --> 00:41:20,985
If the group won't even offer
a sincere apology,

454
00:41:21,505 --> 00:41:23,025
how can our employees feel secure?

455
00:41:25,465 --> 00:41:26,985
Yes. Right.

456
00:41:27,545 --> 00:41:28,625
We completely agree.

457
00:41:31,505 --> 00:41:32,345
How about this?

458
00:41:32,865 --> 00:41:34,905
Tell us what you propose.

459
00:41:34,985 --> 00:41:36,105
We'll do it.

460
00:41:41,065 --> 00:41:42,065
I have two proposals.

461
00:41:43,385 --> 00:41:47,065
The complainants have the legal right
not to withdraw the case.

462
00:41:47,145 --> 00:41:48,185
First,

463
00:41:48,745 --> 00:41:51,825
as an apology, the company will grant
immediately exercisable stock options

464
00:41:52,665 --> 00:41:55,425
worth 200,000 yuan to the lead complainant

465
00:41:55,505 --> 00:41:57,265
and options worth 100,000 yuan
to each of the other four.

466
00:41:57,905 --> 00:42:00,225
It will be treated
as a confidential special award.

467
00:42:00,785 --> 00:42:01,625
Second,

468
00:42:02,865 --> 00:42:05,585
the group must not interfere
in personnel appointments at Lime China.

469
00:42:07,185 --> 00:42:09,225
They won't withdraw the case,
and we're compensating them?

470
00:42:13,745 --> 00:42:15,585
The complainants' lives
may even be at risk.

471
00:42:16,105 --> 00:42:17,385
If they go to the press with the details,

472
00:42:18,465 --> 00:42:19,625
Lime's stock could hit

473
00:42:20,345 --> 00:42:21,945
its daily loss limit
for five straight days.

474
00:42:26,545 --> 00:42:27,865
Go back and discuss it.

475
00:42:27,945 --> 00:42:30,465
Handle it properly, and I'll return.

476
00:42:48,145 --> 00:42:50,465
Are you firing me?

477
00:42:52,465 --> 00:42:54,185
You're so good at your job. Why would we?

478
00:42:54,825 --> 00:42:55,825
Take a look.

479
00:43:00,625 --> 00:43:02,505
STOCK GRANT AGREEMENT

480
00:43:03,465 --> 00:43:07,785
You know the company awards stock
to certain employees every year, right?

481
00:43:08,465 --> 00:43:10,785
Aren't stock awards
only for specialist-level employees?

482
00:43:10,865 --> 00:43:14,145
This is a special stock award
from the company.

483
00:43:14,225 --> 00:43:15,705
I didn't do it for money.

484
00:43:16,985 --> 00:43:18,185
Don't worry.

485
00:43:18,705 --> 00:43:20,465
The grant will be confidential.

486
00:43:21,705 --> 00:43:26,865
Thank you for making our workplace safer.

487
00:43:26,945 --> 00:43:29,865
Without your courage and resourcefulness,

488
00:43:29,945 --> 00:43:31,585
he wouldn't have been brought to justice.

489
00:43:34,825 --> 00:43:35,665
Here.

490
00:43:47,505 --> 00:43:49,225
Thank you, Tracy.

491
00:43:52,105 --> 00:43:55,225
This was also one of Luke's conditions
for returning to work.

492
00:44:03,385 --> 00:44:05,465
Thanks to Flora's persistence,

493
00:44:05,545 --> 00:44:07,225
Dony has received
the punishment he deserved.

494
00:44:07,305 --> 00:44:08,865
With the evidence we provided,

495
00:44:08,945 --> 00:44:12,505
he was convicted of embezzlement
and forcible indecency and insult,

496
00:44:12,585 --> 00:44:14,665
and sentenced to 11 years in prison.

497
00:44:15,345 --> 00:44:16,225
You can come back now.

498
00:44:16,305 --> 00:44:17,585
Stay away much longer,

499
00:44:17,665 --> 00:44:20,425
and the board might replace you outright.

500
00:44:21,345 --> 00:44:22,265
That'd be great.

501
00:44:22,785 --> 00:44:25,465
I'll start another company
and steal Lime's business.

502
00:44:28,145 --> 00:44:30,225
Come back to work, my junior brother.

503
00:44:31,785 --> 00:44:32,705
Next week.

504
00:44:43,825 --> 00:44:44,785
Luke.

505
00:44:47,305 --> 00:44:48,145
Paw.

506
00:44:50,545 --> 00:44:51,505
Silly.

507
00:44:53,545 --> 00:44:54,945
Stay. Sit.

508
00:45:17,785 --> 00:45:18,945
I'm doomed.

509
00:45:19,025 --> 00:45:22,185
New user sign-ups hit another record low.

510
00:45:22,265 --> 00:45:24,665
I've almost burned through
all the investors' money.

511
00:45:24,745 --> 00:45:28,745
What was I thinking,
trying to start a business?

512
00:45:31,145 --> 00:45:32,865
Everything takes time.

513
00:45:32,945 --> 00:45:33,945
Don't rush.

514
00:45:34,025 --> 00:45:36,705
I've tried every kind of promotion,

515
00:45:36,785 --> 00:45:38,225
but nothing's working.

516
00:45:38,305 --> 00:45:39,625
What do I do?

517
00:45:43,585 --> 00:45:44,665
Tell you what.

518
00:45:44,745 --> 00:45:46,585
I'll sign up right now and download it.

519
00:45:46,665 --> 00:45:47,865
Zhu, download it too.

520
00:45:47,945 --> 00:45:49,345
Every user counts.

521
00:45:49,425 --> 00:45:51,265
And we're real, live users.

522
00:45:51,345 --> 00:45:53,345
When Lei gets back,
we'll have him download it too.

523
00:45:53,425 --> 00:45:55,665
And I'll promote it at work. OK?

524
00:45:56,305 --> 00:45:57,385
Really?

525
00:45:58,625 --> 00:46:02,545
Having you two as users
is a huge win for me.

526
00:46:03,545 --> 00:46:06,505
Don't worry. I can limp along
for another month.

527
00:46:07,105 --> 00:46:09,905
If I really go broke,
I'll be counting on you two for meals.

528
00:46:10,505 --> 00:46:13,025
You won't go broke. It'll work out.

529
00:46:14,865 --> 00:46:15,705
It'll work out.

530
00:46:15,785 --> 00:46:16,785
Say something different.

531
00:46:16,865 --> 00:46:18,105
You won't go broke.

532
00:46:18,745 --> 00:46:19,585
See?

533
00:46:21,705 --> 00:46:25,705
